1. Install XAMPP

2. Open XAMPP Control Panel

3. Start:
   - Apache
   - MySQL

4. Go to:
   C:\xampp\htdocs

5. Create folder:
   phpprac

6. Inside phpprac create another folder:
   session

Folder structure:

htdocs
 └── phpprac
      └── session

7. Open phpprac folder in VS Code

8. Inside session folder create file:
   session.php

9. Paste this code:

<?php

session_start();

$_SESSION["name"] = "Sahil";

echo "Session Created<br>";

echo "Session Value: " . $_SESSION["name"];

session_destroy();

echo "<br>Session Deleted";

?>

10. Save file

11. Open browser and run:

http://localhost/phpprac/session/session.php

12. Output:

Session Created
Session Value: Sahil
Session Deleted
